
{% embed '_partials/conditional_parent_or_file_form_wrapper.html.twig' with {
    'form': estColorSsnForm,
    'form_name': 'estColorSsnForm',
    'job_type_config': 'ColorSSN-form',
    'file_heading': 'SSN File:'
} %}

    {% block description %}
        <p><b>Clusters in the submitted SSN are identified, numbered and
            colored.</b> Summary tables, sets of IDs and sequences per cluster are
        provided for sequences identified by a UniProt ID.</p>

        <p>The clusters are numbered and colored using two conventions:
        1) <b>Sequence Count Cluster Number</b> assigned in order of decreasing
        number of UniProt IDs in the cluster; 2) <b>Node Count Cluster Number</b>
        assigned in order of decreasing number of nodes in the cluster.</p>
    {% endblock %}

{% endembed %}

